  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education Scholarship for 100 Female Students</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nigeria like many countries in the world deals with its own refugee crises. The bane of bandits attacks that led to widespread displacement of people in the North Western part of the country. Homes and whole communities have been destroyed, and survivors lost access to educational right of their children. This project will therefore support 100 less privileged female students affected by conflict and lost access to education from Primary to Tertiary level in Nigeria.</narrative>
  </description>
